"Your database needs transactional table support before boards can be created"
" safely from templates. Ask your hosting administrator for help."
msgstr ""
"Il database deve supportare tabelle transazionali per creare bacheche dai "
"modelli in sicurezza. Chiedi aiuto all’amministratore dell’hosting."

#: includes/template-create.php:103
